IMPORT `law08-ch3-finance`

-- Tests for Dieu 94-108. V1 pinned at 1 June 2025, V2 at 1 March 2026, V3 at 1 August 2026. Dieu 94(4)-(5), 95 and
-- 99(3)-(4) take effect on 1 January 2028 in both texts of Dieu 156(2), so the day of the question matters.

§ `Tests: Dieu 94-108`

§§ `Dieu 94 and 95`

@@q 1992 2026
@ref Dieu 94-95 (src:1992-2026)
@@fx `an insurer with capital` : `The capital of an insurer` ; `charter capital paid up` = 500_000_000_000 ; `reserve funds` = 40_000_000_000 ; `undistributed after-tax profit` = 30_000_000_000 ; `funds of the owner set aside from after-tax profit` = 30_000_000_000 ; `other sources the Ministry of Finance allows to be recognised` = 5_000_000_000 ; `amounts the Ministry of Finance requires to be deducted` = 2_000_000_000 ; `amount invested in other insurers, other reinsurers and subsidiaries of insurers and reinsurers` = 3_000_000_000 ; `risk-based capital` = 400_000_000_000
@@fx `a foreign branch with allocated capital` : `The capital of an insurer` ; `capital allocated to a foreign branch` = 300_000_000_000 ; `reserve funds` = 20_000_000_000
@@fx `an insurer with no risk-based capital` : `The capital of an insurer` ; `charter capital paid up` = 500_000_000_000
#ASSERT `Dieu 94(3): the owners' equity` `an insurer with capital` EQUALS 600_000_000_000
#ASSERT `Dieu 94(3): the owners' equity` `a foreign branch with allocated capital` EQUALS 320_000_000_000
#ASSERT `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2026 3 1) (`Dieu 94(4): the available capital on the day` `an insurer with capital` (YMD 2028 1 1)) EQUALS 603_000_000_000
#ASSERT REFUSED `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2026 3 1) (`Dieu 94(4): the available capital on the day` `an insurer with capital` (YMD 2027 12 31))
#ASSERT `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2026 3 1) (`Dieu 95(1): the capital adequacy ratio on the day` `an insurer with capital` (YMD 2028 1 1)) EQUALS 1.5
#ASSERT REFUSED `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2026 3 1) (`Dieu 95(1): the capital adequacy ratio on the day` `an insurer with capital` (YMD 2027 12 31))
#ASSERT REFUSED `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2026 3 1) (`Dieu 95(1): the capital adequacy ratio on the day` `an insurer with no risk-based capital` (YMD 2028 6 1))
#ASSERT `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2026 3 1) (`Dieu 95(2): the insurer keeps the ratio not below the prescribed ratio` `an insurer with capital` (YMD 2028 1 1) 1.5)
#ASSERT NOT `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2026 3 1) (`Dieu 95(2): the insurer keeps the ratio not below the prescribed ratio` `an insurer with capital` (YMD 2028 1 1) 1.51)
#ASSERT REFUSED `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2026 3 1) (`Dieu 95(2): the insurer keeps the ratio not below the prescribed ratio` `an insurer with capital` (YMD 2027 12 31) 1.5)
#ASSERT REFUSED `Dieu 94(6): the minimum charter capital or minimum allocated capital for the kind of insurer`
#ASSERT REFUSED `Dieu 95(4): the Minister of Finance's rules on the capital adequacy ratio, risk-based capital and available capital`
-- the ratio's start date is the same in V1 and V2: one test says so
#ASSERT `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2025 6 1) (`Dieu 95(1): the capital adequacy ratio on the day` `an insurer with capital` (YMD 2028 1 1)) EQUALS 1.5
#ASSERT `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2026 8 1) (`Dieu 95(1): the capital adequacy ratio on the day` `an insurer with capital` (YMD 2028 1 1)) EQUALS 1.5

§§ `Dieu 96`

@@q 2028 2043
@ref Dieu 96 (src:2028-2043)
@@fx `a deposit of two percent` : `A deposit` ; `minimum charter capital or minimum allocated capital at the time of establishment` = 300_000_000_000 ; `amount deposited` = 6_000_000_000
@@fx `a deposit short of two percent` : `A deposit` ; `minimum charter capital or minimum allocated capital at the time of establishment` = 300_000_000_000 ; `amount deposited` = 5_999_999_999
@@fx `a deposit used and replenished on day 90` : `A deposit` ; `the deposit is used to meet commitments to policyholders because solvency is short` = TRUE ; `the Ministry of Finance approved the use in writing` = TRUE ; `date the deposit was used` = YMD 2025 3 1 ; `date the deposit used was replenished` = YMD 2025 5 30
@@fx `a deposit used and replenished on day 91` : `A deposit` ; `the deposit is used to meet commitments to policyholders because solvency is short` = TRUE ; `the Ministry of Finance approved the use in writing` = TRUE ; `date the deposit was used` = YMD 2025 3 1 ; `date the deposit used was replenished` = YMD 2025 5 31
@@fx `a deposit used without approval` : `A deposit` ; `the deposit is used to meet commitments to policyholders because solvency is short` = TRUE
@@fx `a deposit used when solvency is not short` : `A deposit` ; `the Ministry of Finance approved the use in writing` = TRUE
@@fx `the whole deposit withdrawn while trading` : `A deposit` ; `the whole deposit is being withdrawn` = TRUE
@@fx `the whole deposit withdrawn on cessation` : `A deposit` ; `the whole deposit is being withdrawn` = TRUE ; `the business has ceased` = TRUE
@@fx `no withdrawal` : `A deposit`
#ASSERT `Dieu 96(2): the deposit the insurer must make` `a deposit of two percent` EQUALS 6_000_000_000
#ASSERT `Dieu 96(2): the deposit made is the amount the Law requires` `a deposit of two percent`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 96(2): the deposit made is the amount the Law requires` `a deposit short of two percent`
#ASSERT `Dieu 96(3): the use of the deposit is permitted` `a deposit used and replenished on day 90`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 96(3): the use of the deposit is permitted` `a deposit used without approval`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 96(3): the use of the deposit is permitted` `a deposit used when solvency is not short`
#ASSERT `Dieu 96(3): the last day to replenish the deposit` `a deposit used and replenished on day 90` EQUALS YMD 2025 5 30
#ASSERT `Dieu 96(3): the deposit was replenished in time` `a deposit used and replenished on day 90`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 96(3): the deposit was replenished in time` `a deposit used and replenished on day 91`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 96(4): the withdrawal of the whole deposit is permitted` `the whole deposit withdrawn while trading`
#ASSERT `Dieu 96(4): the withdrawal of the whole deposit is permitted` `the whole deposit withdrawn on cessation`
#ASSERT `Dieu 96(4): the withdrawal of the whole deposit is permitted` `no withdrawal`

§§ `Dieu 97 and 98`

@@q 2045 2080
@ref Dieu 97-98 (src:2045-2080)
@@fx `a compliant reserve` : `A technical reserve` ; `set aside separately for each line of insurance` = TRUE ; `corresponds to the liability committed under the contracts` = TRUE ; `separate for contracts with objects inside and outside Vietnam, unless the law provides otherwise` = TRUE ; `backed always by assets that correspond to it, with separate assets for the reserve for contracts abroad` = TRUE ; `computed and set aside using the actuary` = TRUE ; `reviewed and assessed regularly and made good in time` = TRUE ; `the method of setting it aside was registered and approved by the Ministry of Finance` = TRUE
@@fx `a reserve without the actuary` : `A technical reserve` ; `set aside separately for each line of insurance` = TRUE ; `corresponds to the liability committed under the contracts` = TRUE ; `separate for contracts with objects inside and outside Vietnam, unless the law provides otherwise` = TRUE ; `backed always by assets that correspond to it, with separate assets for the reserve for contracts abroad` = TRUE ; `reviewed and assessed regularly and made good in time` = TRUE ; `the method of setting it aside was registered and approved by the Ministry of Finance` = TRUE
@@fx `a reserve with an unapproved method` : `A technical reserve` ; `set aside separately for each line of insurance` = TRUE ; `corresponds to the liability committed under the contracts` = TRUE ; `separate for contracts with objects inside and outside Vietnam, unless the law provides otherwise` = TRUE ; `backed always by assets that correspond to it, with separate assets for the reserve for contracts abroad` = TRUE ; `computed and set aside using the actuary` = TRUE ; `reviewed and assessed regularly and made good in time` = TRUE
#ASSERT `Dieu 97(2)-(3): the technical reserve meets the requirements` `a compliant reserve`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 97(2)-(3): the technical reserve meets the requirements` `a reserve without the actuary`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 97(2)-(3): the technical reserve meets the requirements` `a reserve with an unapproved method`
#ASSERT REFUSED `Dieu 97(4): the Government's rules on setting aside technical reserves and on registering the method`
@@fx `a fund far from its maximum` : `A reserve fund position` ; `after-tax profit of the year` = 100_000_000_000 ; `balance of the compulsory reserve fund` = 10_000_000_000 ; `maximum the Government fixes for the compulsory reserve fund` = JUST 50_000_000_000
@@fx `a fund two billion from its maximum` : `A reserve fund position` ; `after-tax profit of the year` = 100_000_000_000 ; `balance of the compulsory reserve fund` = 48_000_000_000 ; `maximum the Government fixes for the compulsory reserve fund` = JUST 50_000_000_000
@@fx `a fund at its maximum` : `A reserve fund position` ; `after-tax profit of the year` = 100_000_000_000 ; `balance of the compulsory reserve fund` = 50_000_000_000 ; `maximum the Government fixes for the compulsory reserve fund` = JUST 50_000_000_000
@@fx `a fund with no maximum supplied` : `A reserve fund position` ; `after-tax profit of the year` = 100_000_000_000 ; `balance of the compulsory reserve fund` = 10_000_000_000
@@fx `a loss-making year` : `A reserve fund position` ; `after-tax profit of the year` = 0 - 5_000_000_000 ; `balance of the compulsory reserve fund` = 10_000_000_000 ; `maximum the Government fixes for the compulsory reserve fund` = JUST 50_000_000_000
#ASSERT `Dieu 98(2): the contribution to the compulsory reserve fund for the year` `a fund far from its maximum` EQUALS 5_000_000_000
#ASSERT `Dieu 98(2): the contribution to the compulsory reserve fund for the year` `a fund two billion from its maximum` EQUALS 2_000_000_000
#ASSERT `Dieu 98(2): the contribution to the compulsory reserve fund for the year` `a fund at its maximum` EQUALS 0
#ASSERT REFUSED `Dieu 98(2): the contribution to the compulsory reserve fund for the year` `a fund with no maximum supplied`
#ASSERT `Dieu 98(2): the contribution to the compulsory reserve fund for the year` `a loss-making year` EQUALS 0

§§ `Dieu 99 and 100`

@@q 2087 2132
@ref Dieu 99 (src:2087-2132)
@@fx `a sound portfolio` : `An investment position` ; `total investment capital` = 1_000_000_000_000 ; `amount invested in companies of one group with mutual ownership, other than deposits at credit institutions and establishing an enterprise or a branch abroad` = 300_000_000_000 ; `technical reserves are invested only in Vietnam` = TRUE
@@fx `a portfolio with 30.1 percent in one group` : `An investment position` ; `total investment capital` = 1_000_000_000_000 ; `amount invested in companies of one group with mutual ownership, other than deposits at credit institutions and establishing an enterprise or a branch abroad` = 301_000_000_000 ; `technical reserves are invested only in Vietnam` = TRUE
@@fx `a portfolio with borrowed money` : `An investment position` ; `total investment capital` = 1_000_000_000_000 ; `technical reserves are invested only in Vietnam` = TRUE ; `the investment is funded by borrowing, or entrusted to invest in securities, real estate or equity in other enterprises` = TRUE
@@fx `a portfolio with reserves invested abroad` : `An investment position` ; `total investment capital` = 1_000_000_000_000
@@fx `a portfolio reinvested in a shareholder` : `An investment position` ; `total investment capital` = 1_000_000_000_000 ; `technical reserves are invested only in Vietnam` = TRUE ; `reinvested in shareholders, members or their related persons, other than deposits at a credit institution that is a shareholder or member` = TRUE
@@fx `a portfolio with restructuring bonds` : `An investment position` ; `total investment capital` = 1_000_000_000_000 ; `technical reserves are invested only in Vietnam` = TRUE ; `bought corporate bonds issued to restructure the issuer's own debts` = TRUE
@@fx `an entrusted portfolio with a licensed trustee` : `An investment position` ; `total investment capital` = 1_000_000_000_000 ; `technical reserves are invested only in Vietnam` = TRUE ; `is entrusted investment` = TRUE ; `entrusted investment is with a licensed trustee for that line` = TRUE
@@fx `an entrusted portfolio with an unlicensed trustee` : `An investment position` ; `total investment capital` = 1_000_000_000_000 ; `technical reserves are invested only in Vietnam` = TRUE ; `is entrusted investment` = TRUE
