@@fx `all audits and confirmations obtained` : `The audits and reports of an insurer` ; `the annual financial statements were audited independently` = TRUE ; `the solvency and risk management report was confirmed by an independent auditor` = TRUE ; `the report on separating equity and premium sources was confirmed by an independent auditor` = TRUE ; `the reports on linked funds and pension funds were confirmed by an independent auditor` = TRUE
@@fx `audited accounts only` : `The audits and reports of an insurer` ; `the annual financial statements were audited independently` = TRUE
@@fx `an auditor who found fraud and stayed silent` : `The audits and reports of an insurer` ; `the auditor found a material breach, fraud or unusual transaction` = TRUE
@@fx `an auditor who found fraud and reported it` : `The audits and reports of an insurer` ; `the auditor found a material breach, fraud or unusual transaction` = TRUE ; `the auditor notified the Ministry of Finance in writing` = TRUE
@@fx `every periodic report sent` : `The audits and reports of an insurer` ; `sent the financial statements, and the cause and state if the audit opinion was not unqualified` = TRUE ; `sent the report on insurance operations` = TRUE ; `sent the report on separating equity and premium sources` = TRUE ; `sent the solvency and risk management report` = TRUE ; `sent the report on changes in capital for each risk` = TRUE
@@fx `periodic reports missing one` : `The audits and reports of an insurer` ; `sent the financial statements, and the cause and state if the audit opinion was not unqualified` = TRUE ; `sent the report on insurance operations` = TRUE ; `sent the report on separating equity and premium sources` = TRUE ; `sent the solvency and risk management report` = TRUE
@@fx `an unreported development` : `The audits and reports of an insurer` ; `an unusual development affected solvency or reputation, or a financial or other requirement was not met` = TRUE
@@fx `a reported development` : `The audits and reports of an insurer` ; `an unusual development affected solvency or reputation, or a financial or other requirement was not met` = TRUE ; `reported that development to the Ministry of Finance` = TRUE
#ASSERT `Dieu 105(1)-(2): the insurer has obtained the independent audit and confirmations` `all audits and confirmations obtained`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 105(1)-(2): the insurer has obtained the independent audit and confirmations` `audited accounts only`
#ASSERT `Dieu 105(3)(d): the auditor failed to notify the Ministry of Finance` `an auditor who found fraud and stayed silent`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 105(3)(d): the auditor failed to notify the Ministry of Finance` `an auditor who found fraud and reported it`
#ASSERT REFUSED `Dieu 105(4): the Minister of Finance's rules on confirmations`
#ASSERT `Dieu 106(1): the insurer has sent the Ministry of Finance the periodic reports` `every periodic report sent`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 106(1): the insurer has sent the Ministry of Finance the periodic reports` `periodic reports missing one`
#ASSERT `Dieu 106(2): the insurer failed to report an unusual development or a failure to meet requirements` `an unreported development`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 106(2): the insurer failed to report an unusual development or a failure to meet requirements` `a reported development`
#ASSERT REFUSED `Dieu 106(3): the Minister of Finance's rules on reports and information`
@@fx `profit left after funds and obligations` : `A transfer of profit or assets abroad` ; `is profit belonging to foreign investors left after setting aside funds, meeting financial obligations and keeping the capital adequacy ratio and solvency` = TRUE ; `follows Vietnamese law on transferring money and assets` = TRUE
@@fx `assets left at the end of business` : `A transfer of profit or assets abroad` ; `is assets belonging to foreign investors left after ending business in Vietnam` = TRUE ; `follows Vietnamese law on transferring money and assets` = TRUE
@@fx `profit transferred outside the transfer rules` : `A transfer of profit or assets abroad` ; `is profit belonging to foreign investors left after setting aside funds, meeting financial obligations and keeping the capital adequacy ratio and solvency` = TRUE
@@fx `a transfer of something else` : `A transfer of profit or assets abroad` ; `follows Vietnamese law on transferring money and assets` = TRUE
#ASSERT `Dieu 107: the transfer abroad is permitted` `profit left after funds and obligations`
#ASSERT `Dieu 107: the transfer abroad is permitted` `assets left at the end of business`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 107: the transfer abroad is permitted` `profit transferred outside the transfer rules`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 107: the transfer abroad is permitted` `a transfer of something else`
